[41.718791, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.000697ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.778432ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.496991ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.405854ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.129146ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(2.701497ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(1.147285ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.422124ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
